["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">割と</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わりと</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">相当地；比较；颇；相对地；出人意料地</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">割引</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わりびき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">折扣；减价；折让；折扣单位（十分之几）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"174932\"><ruby>現金払<rp>(</rp><rt>げんきんばら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いには１０パーセント<ruby>割引<rp>(</rp><rt>わりびき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いたします。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">如用现金付款，我们给予九折优惠。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/895842\" title=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">割る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">分割；除（数）；切割；切开；分成两半；分离；分开；撕裂；打破；弄碎；击碎；稀释；冲淡；降至…以下；低于；打折；折价；跨越；越过</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"195710\">マイケルは<ruby>皿<rp>(</rp><rt>さら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>割<rp>(</rp><rt>わ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ってしまった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">迈克尔打破了盘子。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">悪い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わるい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">坏；不好；令人不满的；质量差；低劣；不足；邪恶；有罪；丑陋；不美观；有过错；应受责备；理亏；不擅长；做得不好；无利可图；无益；对不起；我的不好；不可原谅</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"74724\">これは<ruby>悪<rp>(</rp><rt>わる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はなし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ではないでしょう？</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这不是一个毫无吸引力的建议,不是吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">悪口</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わるくち</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">坏话；谩骂；诋毁；中伤；恶言；骂人话</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">悪者</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わるもの</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">坏人；恶棍；歹徒；坏蛋</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"228583\">いない<ruby>者<rp>(</rp><rt>もの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がいつも<ruby>悪者<rp>(</rp><rt>わるもの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>になる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">缺席总是错误的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">割れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">われる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">破裂；碎裂；破损；裂开；开裂；龟裂；被撕裂；分裂；产生分歧；意见不一；显露；暴露；真相大白；败露；失真；破音；能整除；无余数地整除；跌破；降至最低限度以下</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"197036\">プラスチックは<ruby>割<rp>(</rp><rt>わ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れにくい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">塑胶不会轻易破损</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">我々</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">われわれ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">代词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">代名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">我们</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"216245\">しかし<ruby>我々<rp>(</rp><rt>われわれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なしで<ruby>続行<rp>(</rp><rt>ぞっこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">但是,我们没有他。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">椀</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（木制）碗；碗（计数词）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"213295\">そのお<ruby>椀<rp>(</rp><rt>わん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のスープはとてもおいしかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">碗里的汤很好吃</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">湾</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">湾；海湾</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"141363\"><ruby>川<rp>(</rp><rt>かわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>山<rp>(</rp><rt>やま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>下<rp>(</rp><rt>くだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>って<ruby>湾<rp>(</rp><rt>わん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>注<rp>(</rp><rt>そそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いでいる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">河水从山上流到下面的海湾</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">碗</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">碗；陶瓷碗；瓷碗；碗（用于计数食物或饮料）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ワンピース</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">连衣裙；一体式；连体式（如连体泳衣）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"222973\">このワンピースはいくらですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这裙子多少钱?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ワープロ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">文字处理机；字处理器</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"222986\">このワープロをお<ruby>借<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りしていいですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我能用这个字处理器吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">日</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/kanji/\">N5</a>日；太阳</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ニチ・ジツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ひ・か</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><